                                                "sense_id": "5f9bee4b-3cdf-314a-9883-80615ac1c4fd",
                                                "text": "Estonia were struggling to get to grips with the game while Ireland were showing a composure and guile that demonstrated their experience in play-off ties."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94ade7ca-46ec-36d6-82ee-caf93b9897bf",
